    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features \u2013 Step Into the Role of a Classic Detective:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interview Intriguing Guests</strong> \u2013 Question suspects and uncover hidden motives through dynamic conversations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt for the Murder Weapon</strong> \u2013 Search a mansion filled with everyday objects... but only one is the killer\u2019s tool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the Case</strong> \u2013 Secure the weapon, identify the culprit, and make the arrest before the police arrives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a New Manor Every Time</strong> \u2013 Investigate a procedurally-generated 3-story mansion with secrets behind every door.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Vibe</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in rich color or switch to noir black &amp; white for that classic detective feel.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features \u2013 Step Into the Role of a Classic Detective:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interview Intriguing Guests</strong> \u2013 Question suspects and uncover hidden motives through dynamic conversations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt for the Murder Weapon</strong> \u2013 Search a mansion filled with everyday objects... but only one is the killer\u2019s tool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the Case</strong> \u2013 Secure the weapon, identify the culprit, and make the arrest before the police arrives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a New Manor Every Time</strong> \u2013 Investigate a procedurally-generated 3-story mansion with secrets behind every door.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Vibe</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in rich color or switch to noir black &amp; white for that classic detective feel.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "When a wealthy host is found dead during a weekend retreat, you're the only one who can solve the murder. With the police delayed and a storm closing in, you have one hour to uncover the truth.\u00a0Search the manor, question the guests, and unravel the mystery\u2026 before time runs out.\u00a0",
